          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പുരസ്കാരം — puraskāraṁ — \"an award\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആ ഗായകന് ഒരു വലിയ പുരസ്കാരം കിട്ടി. ā gāyakanŭ oru valiya puraskāraṁ kiṭṭi. That singer got a big award."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word; സമ്മാനം is the everyday prize."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പുരസ്കാരം (puraskāraṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit puraskāra, \"placing in front, honouring, distinction\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
