          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ജേതാവ് (jētāvŭ) is borrowed from Sanskrit jetṛ, \"victorious; a conqueror\" (Monier-Williams). Sanskrit nouns in -tṛ come into Malayalam in -താവ്, as in ശ്രോതാവ്."
